Scope

This licence covers the source code of the build pipeline and the web viewer
only. It does not cover the neuroimaging data or the assets derived from it:
everything under data/, public/models/ and public/diffusion/ stays under the
terms of its origin, listed in README.md and docs/reference/references.md, with
the full texts in public/models/licenses/. Those terms include the FreeSurfer
Software License, the HCP Open Access Data Use Terms, the non-commercial CAB-NP
License, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (Julich-Brain), MIT (PAM50) and CC0 1.0.

Planum is for research and education. It is not a medical device and must
not be used for diagnosis, treatment or any other clinical decision.
